{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02551","headline":"奉和七夕宴悬圃应制二首 一 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和七夕宴悬圃应制二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"牛闺临浅汉，鸾驷涉秋河。\n两怀萦别绪，一宿庆停梭。\n星模铅里靥，月写黛中蛾。\n奈许今宵度，长婴离恨多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02551.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02551","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}